stan4bart is licensed under GPL (>= 3).

It bundles third-party components under compatible terms:

Walnutpie headers (the WALNUTS sampler)
  Location:  inst/include/walnutpie/*, inst/include/walnutpie.hpp
  License:   MIT (see inst/include/WALNUTPIE_LICENSE)
  Copyright: (c) 2025--2026 by the Walnutpie Developers
  Provenance: vendored from https://github.com/flatironinstitute/walnutpie
              at commit f3c1833117d9d2f76db1671d70d2ce0810ad8436
              (see inst/include/WALNUTPIE_VERSION). The headers are upstream
              verbatim except for one added method, refresh_logp_grad(),
              without which a target swapped between transitions is scored
              stale; it is set out in inst/include/WALNUTPIE_VERSION.
  The MIT license permits redistribution within a GPL-licensed work; the
  copyright notice and permission notice are retained in WALNUTPIE_LICENSE.

Other bundled sources retain their upstream terms:
  R/rstanarm_functions.R   derived from rstanarm (GPL-3)
  R/lme4_functions.R       derived from lme4 (GPL-2 | GPL-3)
  tools/build-aux/config.guess, config.sub   (GPL with the autoconf exception)
  tools/m4/ax_*.m4         (FSF All-Permissive / autoconf-macro terms)

The embedded Stan sampler and the vendored StanHeaders, sundials (CVODES), and
rstan trees were removed; the parametric conditional is now drawn with WALNUTS.
